 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 122522,
   "ANSWER": "<p>Natural acceptance of human values means that the values required for human living are already acceptable to us at the level of the Self. When we understand harmony at different levels, our participation in that harmony becomes our value. In relationship, values such as trust, respect, affection, care, guidance, reverence, glory, gratitude and love lead to mutual happiness. In work with the rest of nature, right utilisation, protection and enrichment lead to prosperity and preservation of nature. These values are not imposed from outside; they are naturally acceptable because every human being wants happiness, prosperity, relationship and harmony. When right understanding develops, value-based living becomes natural and leads to harmony at individual, family, society and nature levels.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21LEM202T",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO8",
    "PLO9",
    "PLO12"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain natural acceptance of human values.</p>\n",
